      "body": "## Introduction to Repository Management\n\n<img alt=\"original github octocat\" src=\"https://octodex.github.com/images/original.png\" align=\"left\" height=\"80px\" />\n\n\ud83d\udc4b Hey there @KokoaSkr1! Welcome to your Skills exercise!\n\nIn this exercise, you&#39;ll configure your repository for easier collaboration. You&#39;ll learn how to protect your code, prepare for collaboration, and foster healthy growth in your projects.\n\n---\n\n\u2728 **This is an interactive, hands-on GitHub Skills exercise!**\n\nAs you complete each step, I\u2019ll leave updates in the comments:\n\n- \u2705 Check your work and guide you forward\n- \ud83d\udca1 Share helpful tips and resources\n- \ud83d\ude80 Celebrate your progress and completion\n\nLet\u2019s get started - good luck and have fun!\n\n<sub>\u2014 Mona</sub>\n",
